  "description": {
   "en": "Mei was once a totally ordinary person until she was in an accident that ended her current life and transported her to the world of her favorite Otome game as \"May\", a villainess. However, the twist in this game is that there are multiple protagonists, all villainesses! The idea is that you take down your rivals and create a harem of hot guys.\n\nPlaying the game was pretty fun, but actually living through it was a completely different story. Though she always had a good relationship with Prince Remy, May had zero capacity for villainy and always ended up on the wrong side of somebody else's blade or poison vial.\n\nNo matter how many times she is reincarnated, the outcome is the same, and eventually, she decides to give up being a villainess altogether.\n\nOn her next run, she ignores all the possible routes and decides to stay inside her home and live a slow life. Just as she finally finds some semblance of peace, the prince arrives and informs her that he is ready to \"take her home.\"\n\nHe had been consistently kind in every life she had lived up until this one, but now...\n\n(Source: DLsite garumani, official)\n\n| Namespace | Tags |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| male | yandere |\n| female | big breasts, cunnilingus, nakadashi, paizuri, rape |\n| other | multi-work series |",
   "ja": "ごく普通の一般人、芽衣はある日事故死をし\n18禁乙女ゲームの主人公、悪役令嬢である「メイ」に転生をした\n…が、そのゲームは「複数主人公!全員悪役令嬢!\nライバルを蹴落としてハーレムを築こう!」という物\n\n遊ぶ側のときは楽しかった設定も\nいざ自分の身に降りかかれば苛烈な競争でしかなく\n唯一、王子であるレミ殿下とはいつも良い感じなものの\n悪役適正がないメイは最終的に蹴落とされ\nバッドエンドばかり歩んでいた\n　\nしかし嘆いたところで何度生まれ変わっても必ず同じ世界\n幸か不幸かいい加減に学習をしてきたメイはついに「脱、悪役令嬢」を掲げる\n　\nそんなこんなで転生をしても、記憶にあるルートは全て無視\n引きこもりながらのんびり過ごし始めた5回目の人生は\n想像以上に順調で今度こそ平和を掴んだ……と思いきや\n今回の人生では関わらないようにと決めていた殿下がやってきて\n「やっと君を迎える準備ができたよ」と意味深な発言\n　\n何度やり直しても常に優しかった殿下の本性と\nついにたどり着いたはずの平和のカラクリは……――"
  },
